 "about": "What the official client (sdk/src/index.ts: req, refusalWait, plainAppendReplays, retryableRequestError) does when every attempt of one request gets the same answer: the waits it makes before sending it again, in milliseconds, after which the answer surfaces. [] means it is not sent again. status 0 is a transport failure. Pinned by sdk/scripts/refusal-schedule.test.mjs and, for the #149 ramp's driver (bench/ramp/population-mode.patch, bench/population_rules.rs), by bench/ramp/test_ramp.py.",
